namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamHoloFoil {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamHoloFoil.h#DreamHoloFoil
    src   "A trading card's holo foil over an image, a sprite, a texture or a rect block: rainbow bands that slide as the angle of view\nchanges, a glare across the card and sparkles that twinkle as it turns, where the foil mask says. The angle of view is the\npointer's offset from the centre, a tilt card's tilt, or set by hand.\n\nDrawn by a material of its own (DreamUI_HoloFoil, made by DreamShader from DShader/DreamUI_HoloFoil.dsm), which the element\ndraws with while the foil is on; the material shades the element as the default one does and adds the foil. A material is\na draw call of its own, which a few cards on screen can afford."
    text  "集换式卡牌的全息箔，叠加在图像、Sprite、纹理或矩形块上：彩虹色带会随视角变化\n而滑动，卡面上有一道眩光，转动时还有闪烁的闪光点，位置由箔遮罩决定。视角是\n指针相对中心的偏移、倾斜卡牌的倾斜角度，或手动设置。\n\n由独立材质（DreamUI_HoloFoil，由DreamShader从DShader/DreamUI_HoloFoil.dsm生成）绘制，全息箔开启时\n元素使用该材质绘制；该材质像默认材质一样为元素着色，并叠加箔效果。每个材质\n都会产生一次独立的绘制调用，屏幕上有少量卡牌时还可以承受。"
    state machine
}

